    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 110 Griffith Hall is a larger than average one bedroom apartment which needs to be viewed to appreciate the bright, spacious and well proportioned accommodation on offer. It is presented in excellent condition throughout and has a south facing balcony off the living area.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an open plan living room cum dining room, kitchen, double bedroom and a shower room. The living area enjoys an abundance of natural light due to its southerly aspect and the large floor to ceiling picture windows which run the entire length of the room and overlook the beautifully kept gardens. \r\n\r\nGriffith Hall is a modern well designed gated residential development situated just off Griffith Avenue. The landscaped communal grounds are attractively planted and very well maintained. A wide selection of residential amenities and services are located within a short distance of this sought-after scheme which is convenient to the city centre, airport and M1/M50 motorways.\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tApprox. 590 sq ft\r\n\r\n•\tVery spacious 1-bedroom ground floor apartment\r\n\r\n•\tSouth-facing balcony/terrace\r\n\r\n•\tUnderfloor heating\r\n\r\n•\tDouble-glazed uPVC windows\r\n\r\n•\tAbundance of natural light in the living space\r\n\r\n•\tSecure designated parking space\r\n\r\n•\tAmple visitor parking\r\n\r\n•\tWell-managed gated development\r\n\r\n•\tManagement company: KPM"
      },
      {
